# PostgreSQL Data Persistence Setup - Complete Package

## 📦 What You Have Now

This directory contains everything needed to set up PostgreSQL with permanent data persistence for the Odoo Hackathon project.

---

## 🚀 Quick Start (3 Steps)

### 1️⃣ Open PowerShell as Administrator
- Press `Win + X` → Select "Windows PowerShell (Admin)"

### 2️⃣ Run Setup
```powershell
Set-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Scope CurrentUser -Force
& "D:\Odoo Hackathon\backend\setup-postgresql-complete.ps1"
```

### 3️⃣ Start Backend
```powershell
cd "D:\Odoo Hackathon\backend"
npm run dev
```

**Done!** Data will now persist.

---

